  "description": "The Horizon Tour 10 is built for comfortable, low-maintenance everyday riding, with a clean, integrated design and practical equipment throughout. Bright LED lighting keeps you visible in urban environments, while the Racktime carrier with KID'n'CARRY and SNAPIT 2.0 compatibility makes carrying accessories or a child seat easy.\n\nIts belt-drive paired with an internal gear hub ensures exceptionally smooth, quiet shifting and minimal upkeep. An adjustable stem helps you find a comfortable riding position, while SP Connect allows secure smartphone mounting navigation and connectivity. Full-coverage fenders and a 100mm suspension fork add comfort on rough paths and unpaved routes. Schwalbe Energizer Plus tires deliver strong puncture protection and dependable traction for everyday urban travel.\n\nPowered by the Bosch Performance Line PX motor and a 720Wh PowerTube battery, it supports long distances. The battery removes easily for charging and the bike is compatible with Bosch PowerMore for extra range. Connectivity functions like ride data and system updates can be accessed via the Bosch eBike Flow App.",
